---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
const title = "Best Hosting for Portfolio in India Under Rs 2000/Year (2026)";
const desc = "Cheapest hosting for freelancer portfolio in India: Hostinger vs others, renewal trap, what beginners need.";
---
<Layout title={title} desc={desc}>
<main class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-4 pb-10">
<div class="text-xs text-gray-500 mt-4">Affiliate disclosure: hosting links may earn commission at no extra cost. Prices checked Sept 2026.</div>
<div class="text-xs text-gray-500 mt-1">By Noyel G • Updated 6 Sept 2026</div>
<h1 class="text-3xl font-extrabold mt-1">Hosting for portfolio under Rs 2000/yr?</h1>
<p class="text-gray-600 mt-1">You need 1 page + contact + fast load. Don't buy Rs 8000 VPS.</p>
<div class="bg-white border shadow rounded-2xl p-4 mt-4">
<div class="font-bold">Winner for beginners: Hostinger Single / Premium</div>
<div class="text-sm text-gray-600 mt-1">Why: 1-click portfolio, free SSL, INR pricing, 30-day refund. Renewal Rs 1500-3500/yr - check 48-mo lock to save. Avoid 1-mo plans (costly).</div>
<div class="text-sm mt-2">Need: 1 website, 10GB, free domain first year on 12-mo+. Don't need: VPS, daily backup upsell.</div>
<a href="#" class="inline-block bg-indigo-600 text-white font-bold px-5 py-2 rounded-full mt-3 text-sm">Check Hostinger price →</a>
<div class="text-xs text-gray-500 mt-1">Link activates after approval. Price same for you.</div>
</div>
<div class="bg-amber-50 border border-amber-200 rounded-2xl p-4 mt-4 text-sm leading-6">
<b>Renewal trap:</b> First year Rs 149/mo, renewal Rs 299/mo. Buy 12-mo minimum, 48-mo if sure. Set calendar reminder 30 days before renewal. Cancel upsells: priority support, daily backup.
</div>
<div class="text-sm mt-4">Free alternative: Cloudflare Pages (this site runs on it, Rs 0). Use if you can code. Use Hostinger if you want 1-click + support.<br/><br/><a href="/tools/freelance-rate-calculator" class="text-indigo-700 font-bold">Rate calculator →</a> | <a href="/tools/upwork-fees-calculator" class="text-indigo-700 font-bold">Upwork calc →</a></div>
</main>
</Layout>
